# Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life gain event (Angel of Vitality's 2024-11-08
# ruling), even when they deal it at the same time: two Healer's Hawks attack Bot2 on turn 5 under Angel of Vitality, and
# each 1 life becomes 2, so Bot1 gains 4 (20 -> 24), not 3 as one gain of 2 would make. Bot2 loses 2 (20 -> 18).

